# Online Examination System

## 📌 Project Overview

The **Online Examination System** is a web-based application developed using **Python, Django, and MySQL**. It allows students to register, log in, attend online examinations, submit answers, and view their results.

The system also provides an administrator dashboard to manage students, subjects, questions, and examination results.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* **Frontend:** HTML, CSS, Bootstrap
* **Backend:** Python, Django
* **Database:** MySQL
* **IDE:** Visual Studio Code
* **Version Control:** Git & GitHub

## ✨ Features

### 👨‍🎓 Student

* Student registration
* Student login
* View available subjects
* Start online examination
* Answer multiple-choice questions
* Submit examination
* Automatically calculate marks
* View examination results
* View previous results
* Manage profile
* Logout

### 👨‍💼 Admin

* Admin login
* Admin dashboard
* Manage students
* Manage subjects
* Add and manage questions
* View examination results
* Manage examination data

